WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.539
Legionaries You are a volunteer serving
France with honor and fidelity.

00:00:07.875 --> 00:00:09.316
You respect defeated enemies.

00:00:10.256 --> 00:00:13.438
You never abandon your dead, your wounded,
or your arms.

00:00:14.594 --> 00:00:18.917
Respect for traditions, devotion to your
leaders, discipline and comradeship are

00:00:18.918 --> 00:00:21.578
your strengths, courage, and loyalty your
virtues.

00:00:21.878 --> 00:00:22.959
It's your Legionary State.

00:00:26.036 --> 00:00:28.597
Some of the participants pretended to
recite their text.

00:00:29.418 --> 00:00:31.639
The warrant officer stops them all at
once.

00:00:32.419 --> 00:00:33.339
Some people are fishes.

00:00:35.484 --> 00:00:37.104
Nothing escapes the dreaded adjutant.

00:00:41.617 --> 00:00:42.378
You're being a fish.

00:00:42.798 --> 00:00:43.678
Don't you know your text?

00:00:44.619 --> 00:00:45.319
Why?

00:00:47.407 --> 00:00:48.208
Bomb the torso.

00:00:49.996 --> 00:00:51.798
Those who speak little have little to
answer.

00:00:52.299 --> 00:00:52.999
Is that it?

00:00:53.180 --> 00:00:54.201
It doesn't work like that.

00:00:54.881 --> 00:00:58.846
Okay, Master Corporal, they're going to
join the local pikes.

00:00:59.526 --> 00:01:00.367
All right, let's go.

00:01:03.370 --> 00:01:05.973
To the Legion, for every mistake comes its
punishment.

00:01:07.542 --> 00:01:09.485
Here, the penalty is a sprint around the
building.

00:01:10.566 --> 00:01:11.727
Not good, not good.

00:01:12.960 --> 00:01:14.181
We're going to refresh their will.

00:01:14.761 --> 00:01:16.402
A sprint, it helps their will to learn.

00:01:17.103 --> 00:01:17.863
That's not good now.

00:01:20.605 --> 00:01:21.605
Rally, rally.

00:01:25.019 --> 00:01:28.821
Once the legionaries are back in line, the
adjutant gives them a second chance.

00:01:30.682 --> 00:01:31.522
You're yelling too much.

00:01:32.142 --> 00:01:33.123
Or talking too fast.

00:01:33.463 --> 00:01:34.163
It's not pretty.

00:01:35.084 --> 00:01:35.865
I know you're hungry.

00:01:36.785 --> 00:01:38.246
You want to get to the table quickly.

00:01:39.127 --> 00:01:40.327
But you don't get to decide.

00:01:42.508 --> 00:01:44.209
We quote the code of honor from the heart.

00:01:44.709 --> 00:01:45.409
We don't shout.

00:01:46.290 --> 00:01:47.350
And we recite calmly.

00:01:48.270 --> 00:01:49.471
Respectful of traditions.

00:01:50.451 --> 00:01:55.873
Attached to your leaders, discipline and
fellowship are your strength.

00:01:56.033 --> 00:01:56.733
Rest.

00:01:57.694 --> 00:01:58.394
We are good.

00:02:00.371 --> 00:02:01.431
But not very well yet.

